Added support for non-BINARY ``ENCODING=BASE64`` values when reading iCalendar and converting to jCal or xCal. Remove the default ``ENCODING=8BIT`` parameter after parsing. Use ``Parameters.encoding`` to read the normalized encoding. Invalid BASE64 data in ``vBinary.base64data`` raises ``Base64DecodingError``. Parsers raise ``ICalParsingError``, ``JCalParsingError``, or ``XCalParsingError`` for their format. AI helped with the code, tests, and review. @radixun
